X. The “Screening-cum-Evaluation Committee” for CAS promotion of Assistant Professors/equivalent cadres in Librarians/Physical Education and Sports from one level to the other higher level shall consist of: A. For University teachers:

i) The Vice-Chancellor or his/her nominee shall be the Chairperson of the Committee;

ii) The Dean of the Faculty concerned;

iii The Head of the Department /Chairperson of the School; and

